  "ground_why": "the photos were fitted on the land the hole had before the lidar heights (commit ee24684, nearly flat). The aerial measures depth weakly: re-fitted on the new land the front bunker moves 6 yd short of where the lidar has it, and on flat ground the outlines match the lidar worse (front IoU 0.43 against 0.56). So the fit keeps that land, and the lidar sets the size (rescale)",
